[{"title":"秋日挈舟茉莉沙追送孔参军即景口占以赠其行 其七","author":"屈大均","text":"几载为閒吏，何曾可代农。\n君前多袒裼，柳下不须恭。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12809,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日挈舟茉莉沙追送孔参军即景口占以赠其行 其八","author":"屈大均","text":"频年赴京阙，讵念使臣劳。\n万里持甘毳，亲年日已高。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12810,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日挈舟茉莉沙追送孔参军即景口占以赠其行 其九","author":"屈大均","text":"且喜台关上，梅花不笑人。\n摩娑古松树，十见老龙鳞。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12811,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日挈舟茉莉沙追送孔参军即景口占以赠其行 其十","author":"屈大均","text":"寡过期中岁，人人亦可师。\n君行苦离索，怅望复来时。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12812,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"弼唐村即景 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"一水细通潮，帆低屡过桥。\n阴阴榕影下，渔父不相招。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12813,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"弼唐村即景 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"片雨从西至，开门爽气侵。\n蝉声似溪水，流入野人心。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12814,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"渔曲 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"霜肥螺有柱，月满蟹多黄。\n一棹将童子，遥遥至海塘。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12815,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"渔曲 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"风俗河豚会，秋来乐事多。\n乘潮下生钓，滥口峭帆过。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12816,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"渔曲 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"花中藏跳白，出没少鱼惊。\n向夕鸣榔去，知予是月明。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12817,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"渔曲 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"水乡鱼蟹贱，吾亦事投竿。\n日夕坐盘石，鹭鸶相与寒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12818,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"屯女吟 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"天生屯女子，五十尚红颜。\n不字盘桓甚，金夫未敢攀。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12819,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"屯女吟 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"十年坤数尽，辛苦一阳来。\n此际成婚媾，同将草昧开。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12820,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"频梦先严有作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"夜夜怀明发，先公梦寐劳。\n儿孤从少小，泪已尽莪蒿。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12821,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"频梦先严有作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"多难凭吾父，提携在梦中。\n此身能老大，不敢恨途穷。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12822,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"频梦先严有作 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"肤发今如此，那能不辱亲。\n梦中长痛哭，惭愧白华身。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12823,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"频梦先严有作 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"五旬今有二，多父一年馀。\n不死如闻道，应能续易书。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12824,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"天濠街妇","author":"屈大均","text":"妾身不随波，岂必长绳系。\n所虑黄口儿，一去无根蒂。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12825,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"戴家二姬","author":"屈大均","text":"可怜双美人，慷慨辞君掌。\n沉珠在井中，化为明月上。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12826,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"潭上作","author":"屈大均","text":"清浅西南潭，白波跳霜雪。\n一片秋光寒，谁知是明月。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12827,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋夕作","author":"屈大均","text":"松露鹤边滴，清冷满石床。\n梦中惊是月，起视白如霜。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12828,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"弄琴有怀石斋翁 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"碧玉楼中客，无弦一素琴。\n泠然林木外，太古有馀音。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12829,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"弄琴有怀石斋翁 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"玉琴长寂寂，神与至人期。\n心外无山水，高深只自知。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12830,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"弄琴有怀石斋翁 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"秋声空外起，一叶亦萧萧。\n吹我鸣琴去，元音满寂寥。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12831,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"兰草 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"兰草不知名，香含朝露清。\n花长休出叶，岁晏忌孤荣。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12832,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"兰草 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"幸与蘼芜并，无花亦自芳。\n美人相忆苦，日夕澧川阳。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12833,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"兰草 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"花叶虽相似，青青有本心。\n亦知霜雪苦，不忍负空林。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12834,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"持蔬轩作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"月出雨犹滴，微光似在林。\n虫寒声渐小，不忍到愁心。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12835,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"持蔬轩作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"蟋蟀寒相语，声声有所思。\n思君似初月，相照未多时。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12836,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"持蔬轩作 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"白云不出户，为我含精华。\n所恐风吹去，离离成海霞。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12837,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"持蔬轩作 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"芙蓉白复红，向暮解还童。\n更拒秋霜甚，凝妆在月中。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12838,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"持蔬轩作 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"猗彼幽兰花，春黄而秋紫。\n颜色能随时，所以媚君子。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12839,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"持蔬轩作 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"花叶皆有香，乃可持为佩。\n幽幽君子心，非兰无所爱。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12840,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"四愿辞 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"愿君似芙蓉，不食犹可衣。\n芙蓉且有实，一一含霜肥。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12841,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"四愿辞 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"愿君如山丹，花红至百日。\n红尽变为黄，犹作纯金质。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12842,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"四愿辞 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"愿君似茨菰，一乳十馀子。\n心心向太阳，岁寒花愈美。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12843,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"四愿辞 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"愿君若琼木，一身作五香。\n朱火欲尽时，芳气犹飘飏。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12844,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"甘蕉经雨后，叶叶有新心。\n舒卷无人见，萧疏又一林。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12845,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"佳色朝来变，微红似带霜。\n但令开满径，何必值重阳。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12846,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"生意怜春草，油油是我心。\n穿冰才一寸，芳气已盈襟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12847,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"又见梅花发，枝枝影向西。\n可怜千万片，飞不到潜溪。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12848,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"红翠双入帘，知自罗浮至。\n口衔麻姑书，催我营春事。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12849,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"春已满浮丘，花开多异色。\n生憎小凤凰，向我花上食。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12850,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其七","author":"屈大均","text":"舟浮香溪来，是我餐霞友。\n小女采荼蘼，已泛长春酒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12851,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其八","author":"屈大均","text":"林鸟喜人归，声声在竹扉。\n花含大小笑，笑客食春薇。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12852,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其九","author":"屈大均","text":"苦瓜君子菜，义不食邪蒿。\n日夕林塘畔，毋辞抱瓮劳。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12853,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十","author":"屈大均","text":"阴尽天无雪，阳生地有雷。\n黄莺一二啭，已使早梅开。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12854,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十一","author":"屈大均","text":"林深晴日少，天在白云中。\n水气多为雨，山光直似空。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12855,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十二","author":"屈大均","text":"鱼脍宜生酒，餐来最益人。\n临溪亲举网，及此一阳春。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12856,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十三","author":"屈大均","text":"门对先公墓，松楸日夕看。\n无田愁薄祭，凄怆一春盘。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12857,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十四","author":"屈大均","text":"负杖还墟落，韶光正及春。\n涧花欣有主，山鸟喜无人。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12858,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十五","author":"屈大均","text":"未有疗饥物，芝华奈尽何。\n白头孀凤老，黄口乳莺多。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12859,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十六","author":"屈大均","text":"幽幽涧底兰，花叶愁枯槁。\n不及尔青蒿，春阳能得早。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12860,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"莱圃杂咏 其十七","author":"屈大均","text":"母竹春多笋，新篁十日齐。\n箨龙谁忍斸，留荫白云溪。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12861,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"隔墙桃花","author":"屈大均","text":"东家复有春，墙上一枝新。\n未得春风吐，夭夭已笑人。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12862,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"风兰","author":"屈大均","text":"一朵风兰好，空生不作趺。\n自来根本异，宁待露沾濡。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12863,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"流溪","author":"屈大均","text":"泉飘百丈带，曲折下流溪。\n车水村村急，春苗莳未齐。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12864,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"古意 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"垂柳与垂杨，枝条有短长。\n柳长杨短短，一体似鸳鸯。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12865,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"古意 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"风流水杨柳，宜水复宜风。\n莫即为花絮，飘飏西复东。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12866,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"古意 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"菱花背日寒，芡花向日暖。\n同是水中根，为心有长短。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12867,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"古意 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"有美云堂树，冬生翠负霜。\n少阴精自固，名以冻青香。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12868,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"闺人寄远曲","author":"屈大均","text":"日月同一光，男女同一性。\n君不爱离居，早归共鸾镜。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12869,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"塞儿曲 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"在北为苍鹰，在南为鹞子。\n秋来奋羽毛，一击辄千里。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12870,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"塞儿曲 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"儿时射鸟鼠，稍长射狐兔。\n生长牛羊中，肥白亦如瓠。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12871,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"塞儿曲 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"壮者食肥美，老者食其馀。\n黄羊与野马，毛血腥衣裾。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12872,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"塞儿曲 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"箕踞而反言，佯为蛮种落。\n袍帽尽鼲貂，拦街弄弦索。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12873,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"塞儿曲 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"自古汉和蕃，不闻蕃和汉。\n汉儿一向眠，自致南朝乱。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12874,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"讯汪子","author":"屈大均","text":"君在黄山口，桃花十里长。\n不知溪上水，流得几峰香。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12875,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"茉莉 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"未开先食蕾，虫细若飞丝。\n叶底粉如雪，香宜月上时。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12876,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"茉莉 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"欲花先摘叶，叶少始花多。\n向夕沾人气，香如膏沐何。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12877,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏古 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"紫芝华正秀，黄鹄翼还开。\n绮皓诚儒者，何曾嫚骂来。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12878,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏古 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"西汉崇儒术，功推陆大夫。\n煌煌新语在，拜手似皋谟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12879,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏古 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"子真冠已挂，全性市门中。\n未肯营妻子，仙人让素风。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12880,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏古 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"梅公有贤女，堪配客星来。\n夫妇桐江曲，东西两钓台。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12881,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏古 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"至今七星濑，多有子陵鱼。\n翁婿皆高逸，垂光后汉书。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12882,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"咏古 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"孟光裘褐者，居与伯通邻。\n何似梅家女，风流在富春。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12883,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"寒食北望燕京作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"陵园那可望，万里冷烟迷。\n辛苦子鹃鸟，年年向北啼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12884,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"寒食北望燕京作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"白虹犹饮恨，黄雀尚衔恩。\n亦有冬青树，何繇种御园。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12885,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"古意 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"点点越罗衣，桃花作泪飞。\n鹧鸪如有意，为唤阿郎归。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12886,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"古意 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"面脂调藁本，留半与薰裳。\n一任蛇床乱，薇芜自有香。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":12887,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}}]